# Developer-local agent state · never a user's business (v40). Found by
# diffing the PUBLISHED vsix against a local rebuild: every shared file
# was byte-identical, and the one extra was .claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
# from this machine's own tooling. It did not reach the registry because
# CI has no such file — but nothing was stopping it.
.claude/**
.mcp.json
